10
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:26,000
Ken Sander. Where's Ken at? Look for his head. There he is.

11
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:33,000
Ken Sanders here in the middle. For those of you interested in the teachings of the New Testament,

