22
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:08,000
I think we step...

23
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:12,000
One way to do that is to step out of the corporate body,

24
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:17,000
kind of get lost in the mix and step into a smaller group of individuals that you can work through that with, right?

25
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:25,000
We have several small groups meeting that take the notes from our sermons and discussion questions

26
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:32,000
and kind of work through those very nuanced teachings of Jesus and how we apply those practically.

27
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:38,000
And that's hard to do by yourself, because I think we all like to justify how we all do things.

28
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:40,000
Is that just me?

29
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:45,000
But I want you to sit in a group and talk about the implications of these parables in our lives.

30
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:48,000
