32
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:55,000
And I would even argue that they invite us into what it truly means to be human

33
00:02:55,000 --> 00:03:00,000
and begin living into the reality and vocation that God created us for.

34
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:05,000
So I want to challenge you to find Ken, make plans for the round table,

35
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:10,000
grab two or three people that you say hi to on Sunday mornings and just like,

36
