"Hey, can we grab dinner and kind of talk about this stuff?"

37
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:15,000
That's the heart.

38
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:18,000
I want you to connect with the body of believers that is Canvas Community Church,

39
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:21,000
